<title>UK: Cantab shares rise after drug test results.</title>
<headline>Cantab shares rise after drug test results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cantab Pharmaceuticals Plc were marked higher on Friday after the British biotech-based drug development group said it had received encouraging results from patient trials on its genital warts treatment.</p>
<p>At 0845 GMT, Cantab shares were indicated 10p higher at 600p.</p>
<p>The TA-GW treatment is being jointly developed with Smithkline Beecham Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
